## Projects
- [China Capital](https://www.icij.org/investigations/china-capital/): How the world’s largest bank advances Beijing’s political priorities and global ambitions.
- [Cancer Calculus](https://www.icij.org/investigations/cancer-calculus/): How Merck keeps the price of its blockbuster cancer drug sky-high, shutting out patients and straining health care systems around the world.
- [Damascus Dossier](https://www.icij.org/investigations/damascus-dossier/): Tens of thousands of secret photos and intelligence files expose the Assad regime’s killing machine.
- [The Coin Laundry](https://www.icij.org/investigations/coin-laundry/): How the crypto boom minted a shadow economy that thrives on crime — and left a trail of devastated victims.
- [China Targets](https://www.icij.org/investigations/china-targets/): How Beijing abuses international institutions to terrorize its critics and extend its repressive tactics worldwide.
- [Caspian Cabals](https://www.icij.org/investigations/caspian-cabals/): How Western oil companies bet on Kazakhstan, turned a blind eye to corruption risks — and ended up at the mercy of Vladimir Putin.
- [Swazi Secrets](https://www.icij.org/investigations/swazi-secrets/): A glimpse inside the tiny kingdom of Eswatini — Africa’s last absolute monarchy — where suspicious money flows and the elite exploit proximity to the king.
