- [Luxembourg Leaks: Global Companies&#8217; Secrets Exposed](https://www.icij.org/investigations/luxembourg-leaks/): New files obtained by ICIJ disclose secret tax structures sought by “Big 4” accounting giants for global brand name companies.
- [中国离岸金融解密 China Leaks](https://www.icij.org/investigations/zhong-guo-chi-jin-rong-jie-mi/): Leaked records reveal offshore holdings of China’s elite.
