- [The Water Barons](https://www.icij.org/investigations/waterbarons/): The explosive growth of private water utility companies raises fears that mankind may be losing control of its most vital resource.
- [Making a Killing](https://www.icij.org/investigations/makingkilling/): A handful of companies with connections to governments, and, sometimes organizations, have profited from war commerce.
- [Big Tobacco Smuggling](https://www.icij.org/investigations/big-tobacco-smuggling/): Down-and-out in developed nations, Big Tobacco is refocusing its lobbying on emerging markets.

